<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>萊乾資訊 LaiQuan｜公司介紹</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='15' fill='%231a1a1a'/%3E%3Cpath d='M37 8 L20 36 L32 36 L28 56 L46 30 L34 30 Z' fill='%23ffce00'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<meta name="description" content="萊乾資訊 LaiQuan — 把好點子通電上線 ⚡ 企業官網、Web App、品牌 UI/UX 與 AI 系統一條龍。從需求訪談、設計原型、開發測試到上線維運，替中小企業與大型團隊打造會發光的數位產品。">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Baloo+2:wght@500;600;700;800&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#fffbec; --bg-alt:#ffffff; --bg-tint:#fff6d6;
    --ink:#1a1a1a; --ink-soft:#2e2a1c;
    --gray:#6b6357; --gray2:#9c9384; --line:rgba(26,26,26,.11);
    --yellow:#ffce00; --yellow-soft:#ffe680; --yellow-wash:#fff6d6; --gold:#9a7a00;
    --sans:"Noto Sans TC",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"PingFang TC","Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    --display:"Baloo 2","Noto Sans TC",-apple-system,"PingFang TC",sans-serif;
    --mono:ui-monospace,"SF Mono",Menlo,monospace;
    --ease:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
    --maxw:940px;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-snap-type:y mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;}
  body{font-family:var(--sans);color:var(--ink);background:var(--bg);line-height:1.5;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}

  /* progress + header */
  .progress{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;height:3px;z-index:80;background:transparent;pointer-events:none;}
  .progress i{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:var(--ink);transition:width .5s var(--ease);}
  @media(max-width:640px){.progress{height:4px;}}
  .topbar{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:70;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:13px clamp(18px,4vw,44px);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(20px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    background:rgba(255,251,236,.8);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .topbar .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-family:var(--display);}
  .topbar .brand .mk{height:26px;width:26px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;}
  .topbar .brand .mk svg{width:16px;height:16px;display:block;}
  .topbar .brand .co{color:var(--gray);font-weight:500;}
  .topbar .links{display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gray);}
  .topbar .links a{transition:color .2s;}
  .topbar .links a:hover{color:var(--ink);}
  @media(max-width:640px){.topbar .links{display:none;}}

  /* dot nav */
  .nav{position:fixed;top:50%;right:max(14px,2vw);transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:60;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;align-items:flex-end;}
  .nav button{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;cursor:pointer;background:none;border:0;padding:3px 0 3px 8px;}
  .nav button::after{content:"";width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid rgba(26,26,26,.32);background:transparent;
    transition:transform .35s var(--ease),background .35s,border-color .35s;}
  .nav button[data-active="true"]::after{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);transform:scale(1.6);}
  .nav .lbl{margin-right:11px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(6px);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 11px;white-space:nowrap;
    opacity:0;transform:translateX(6px);transition:opacity .25s,transform .25s;pointer-events:none;box-shadow:2px 3px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.16);}
  .nav button:hover .lbl,.nav button:focus-visible .lbl{opacity:1;transform:none;}
  @media(max-width:820px){.nav{display:none;}}

  /* slides */
  .slide{min-height:100svh;scroll-snap-align:start;scroll-snap-stop:always;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:110px clamp(22px,5vw,40px) 84px;position:relative;}
  .slide.alt{background:var(--bg-alt);}
  .slide.tint{background:var(--bg-tint);}
  .slide.punch{background:var(--yellow);overflow:hidden;}
  .inner{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .wide{max-width:1120px;}

  .eyebrow{display:inline-block;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--yellow);background:var(--ink);
    letter-spacing:.02em;padding:6px 15px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:20px;}
  h1{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(40px,7.4vw,88px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.02;text-wrap:balance;}
  h2{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(31px,4.9vw,60px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.005em;line-height:1.08;text-wrap:balance;}
  .lead{font-size:clamp(17px,2.3vw,23px);font-weight:400;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.55;max-width:760px;margin:22px auto 0;letter-spacing:.005em;}
  .fine{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--gray2);margin-top:16px;letter-spacing:.02em;font-weight:500;}
  .punch .lead{color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .punch .fine{color:#5c5322;}

  /* 封面的大閃電（取自官網 Hero） */
  .bolts{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;pointer-events:none;}
  .bolt{position:absolute;clip-path:polygon(58% 0,18% 52%,46% 52%,30% 100%,82% 40%,52% 40%);}
  .bolt.dark{right:6vw;top:14vh;width:min(300px,26vw);height:min(430px,44vh);background:var(--ink);opacity:.9;}
  .bolt.light{right:8.5vw;top:11.5vh;width:min(300px,26vw);height:min(430px,44vh);background:#fff;opacity:.42;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.bolts{opacity:.5;}.bolt.dark{right:-4vw;}.bolt.light{right:-2vw;}}

  .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;
    padding:14px 28px;border-radius:980px;font-family:var(--display);
    transition:transform .22s var(--ease),box-shadow .22s;margin-top:8px;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.18);}
  .cta:hover{transform:translate(-1px,-2px);box-shadow:5px 7px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.22);}
  .cta.ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:3px 4px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.14);}
  .cta.ghost:hover{background:rgba(26,26,26,.05);}
  .linkrow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;justify-content:center;margin-top:34px;}

  .scrollhint{position:absolute;bottom:34px;left:0;right:0;margin:0 auto;width:max-content;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:7px;z-index:2;}
  .scrollhint .chev{width:16px;height:16px;border-right:2px solid var(--ink-soft);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink-soft);transform:rotate(45deg);animation:bob 1.8s var(--ease) infinite;}
  @keyframes bob{0%,100%{transform:rotate(45deg) translate(0,0);opacity:.85}50%{transform:rotate(45deg) translate(3px,3px);opacity:.35}}

  /* 通用格線 */
  .grid{display:grid;gap:clamp(16px,2.4vw,26px);margin-top:44px;text-align:left;}
  .g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);}
  .g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}
  .g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  @media(max-width:820px){.g4,.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  @media(max-width:520px){.g4,.g3{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .cell .k{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,20px);font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:7px;}
  .cell .d{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.6;}
  .cell .ic{font-size:26px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;display:block;}

  /* 服務卡（有邊框、硬陰影） */
  .card{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:18px;padding:24px 22px 26px;box-shadow:5px 6px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.13);}
  .card .pts{list-style:none;margin:14px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;}
  .card .pts li{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink);padding-left:18px;position:relative;font-weight:500;}
  .card .pts li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:6px;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--yellow);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);}

  /* 數字列 */
  .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(18px,3vw,40px);margin-top:52px;}
  @media(max-width:640px){.stats{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:26px;}}
  .stats .n{font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(56px,9vw,104px);font-weight:800;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
  .stats .l{font-size:15px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:8px;font-weight:500;}

  /* 作品卡 */
  .works{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:clamp(14px,2vw,22px);margin-top:38px;text-align:left;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.works{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.works{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .wk{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:4px 5px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.12);
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform .22s var(--ease),box-shadow .22s;}
  a.wk:hover{transform:translate(-1px,-3px);box-shadow:7px 9px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.16);}
  .wk .th{height:62px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .wk .bd{padding:12px 14px 15px;flex:1;}
  .wk .tg{display:inline-block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);background:var(--yellow);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius:999px;padding:1px 9px;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .wk .nm{font-family:var(--display);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;}
  .wk .ds{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.5;margin-top:5px;}

  /* 案例聚光燈 */
  .pv-wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1fr;gap:clamp(24px,4vw,56px);align-items:center;text-align:left;margin-top:38px;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.pv-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .pv-side .why{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin:18px 0 24px;}
  .pv-side .why li{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);padding-left:26px;position:relative;line-height:1.55;font-weight:500;}
  .pv-side .why li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:6px;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--yellow);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .pchip{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:9px;background:var(--yellow);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:999px;
    padding:10px 22px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:16px;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.16);}
  .pchip small{font-weight:600;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);}

  /* 裝置外框 + 模擬畫面 */
  .device{border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:8px 10px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.14);}
  .dev-head{height:34px;background:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:0 14px;}
  .dev-head .d{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--yellow);}
  .dev-head .t{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-left:6px;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--mono);}
  .dev-body{padding:15px;background:#fffdf5;}
  .bub{max-width:88%;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:13px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .bub.me{margin-left:auto;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;}
  .bub.ok{background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;color:#14532d;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;}
  .bub.err{background:#fff4f4;border:1px solid #fbd0d0;color:#7f1d1d;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;}
  .bub .fn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;word-break:break-all;}
  /* 儀表板列 */
  .dash .dr{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .8fr 62px;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;
    padding:9px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0e8d4;}
  .dash .dr:last-child{border-bottom:0;}
  .dash .dh{font-size:10.5px;color:var(--gray);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .dash .nm{font-weight:700;}
  .dash .bar{height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#f2ead2;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);overflow:hidden;}
  .dash .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--yellow);}
  .dash .pc{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:800;font-size:12.5px;text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .pill{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);white-space:nowrap;}
  .pill.warn{background:var(--yellow);}
  .pill.ok{background:#fff;color:var(--gray);}

  /* 流程 */
  .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:13px;margin-top:44px;text-align:left;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
  .fstep{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:16px;padding:17px 16px 19px;box-shadow:4px 5px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.12);}
  .fstep .n{font-family:var(--display);font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ink);background:var(--yellow);width:29px;height:29px;
    border-radius:999px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:11px;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);}
  .fstep .k{font-family:var(--display);font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:5px;}
  .fstep .d{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);line-height:1.5;}

  /* 費率表 */
  .qlist{margin-top:34px;text-align:left;max-width:720px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
  .qrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .qrow .l{font-size:15.5px;font-weight:600;}
  .qrow .l small{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--gray2);font-weight:400;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.5;}
  .qrow .v{font-family:var(--display);font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;}
  .qrow .v small{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gray2);font-weight:600;margin-right:3px;}
  .qnote{font-size:13px;color:var(--gray);margin-top:20px;text-align:center;font-weight:500;}

  /* 聯絡 */
  .contact{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;margin-top:30px;}
  .cbox{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:13px 20px;text-align:left;box-shadow:3px 4px 0 rgba(26,26,26,.16);}
  .cbox .cl{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gray2);letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:3px;}
  .cbox .cv{font-family:var(--display);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;}

  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .9s var(--ease),transform .9s var(--ease);}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none;}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html{scroll-snap-type:none;scroll-behavior:auto;}
    .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none;}
    .scrollhint .chev{animation:none;}
  }

  /* 筆電高度（1280x800 / 1440x720）收緊密集頁，簡報現場 1080p 不套用 */
  @media(min-width:900px) and (max-height:900px){
    #s6 .eyebrow,#s11 .eyebrow{margin-bottom:10px;}
    #s6 h2{font-size:46px;} #s6 .lead{font-size:17px;margin-top:10px;}
    #s6 .works{margin-top:22px;gap:14px;}
    #s6 .wk .th{height:48px;font-size:23px;}
    #s6 .wk .bd{padding:10px 12px 12px;}
    #s6 .wk .ds{font-size:12px;}
    #s6 .fine{margin-top:12px;}
    #s11 h2{font-size:46px;}
    #s11 .qlist{margin-top:20px;}
    #s11 .qrow{padding:9px 0;}
    #s11 .qnote{margin-top:14px;}
    #s9 .flow{margin-top:28px;}
    #s10 .grid{margin-top:28px;}
  }
  /* 更矮的筆電（1440x720 這類）：案例頁與費率頁還會溢出，再收一階。
     ⚠️ 只在 max-height:780px 生效；1080p 簡報現場不套用。 */
  @media(min-width:900px) and (max-height:780px){
    #s7 .eyebrow,#s8 .eyebrow{margin-bottom:8px;}
    #s7 h2,#s8 h2{font-size:44px;}
    #s7 .pv-wrap,#s8 .pv-wrap{margin-top:20px;}
    #s7 .pv-side .why,#s8 .pv-side .why{gap:8px;margin:12px 0 16px;}
    #s7 .pv-side .why li,#s8 .pv-side .why li{font-size:14px;}
    #s7 .dev-body,#s8 .dev-body{padding:11px;}
    #s7 .bub{padding:7px 11px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:6px;}
    #s8 .dash .dr{padding:7px 4px;}
    #s7 .pchip,#s8 .pchip{padding:8px 18px;font-size:15px;}
    #s11 h2{font-size:40px;}
    #s11 .qlist{margin-top:14px;}
    #s11 .qrow{padding:6px 0;}
    #s11 .qrow .l{font-size:14.5px;}
    #s11 .qrow .l small{font-size:12px;margin-top:2px;}
    #s11 .qrow .v{font-size:14.5px;}
    #s11 .qnote{margin-top:10px;}
    #s6 .works{margin-top:18px;}
    #s12 .contact{margin-top:22px;}
    #s12 .linkrow{margin-top:24px;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="progress"><i id="pfill"></i></div>

<header class="topbar">
  <a class="brand" href="#s1"><span class="mk"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M37 8 L20 36 L32 36 L28 56 L46 30 L34 30 Z" fill="#ffce00"/></svg></span>萊乾資訊 LaiQuan<span class="co">· 公司介紹</span></a>
  <nav class="links">
    <a href="https://laiquan.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener">laiquan.co</a>
    <a href="#s6">作品</a>
    <a href="#s12">聯絡我們</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<nav class="nav" id="dots" aria-label="投影片導覽"></nav>

<!-- 1 封面 -->
<section class="slide punch" id="s1" data-label="封面">
  <div class="bolts" aria-hidden="true"><div class="bolt dark"></div><div class="bolt light"></div></div>
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">⚡ 企業官網 · Web App · 品牌 UI/UX</div>
    <h1 class="reveal" style="transition-delay:.06s">把好點子<br>通電上線</h1>
    <p class="lead reveal" style="transition-delay:.12s">萊乾資訊替中小企業到大型團隊，打造會發光的數位產品。<br>從設計到開發一條龍，讓你的生意閃電起步。</p>
    <p class="fine reveal" style="transition-delay:.2s">萊乾資訊 LaiQuan Information　·　laiquan.co　·　台北 · 新北 · 全台遠端服務</p>
  </div>
  <div class="scrollhint reveal" style="transition-delay:.3s">Scroll<span class="chev"></span></div>
</section>

<!-- 2 我們是誰 -->
<section class="slide alt" id="s2" data-label="我們是誰">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="eyebrow reveal">我們是誰</div>
    <h2 class="reveal" style="transition-delay:.05s">一支從設計做到<br>上線維運的團隊。</h2>
    <p class="lead reveal" style="transition-delay:.12s">很多公司把設計、前端、後端、上線切成四段外包，接縫都由業主自己扛。萊乾資訊把這四段收在同一支團隊裡 —— 需求訪談、UI/UX、系統開發、雲端部署到後續維運，一個窗口負責到底，你只需要專心把生意做好。</p>
